#City-Shape						KEY:Druid ACF ~ City-Shape													CATEGORY:ACF			TYPE:DruidWildShape.ACF																																						PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Druid=4],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Wild Shape]																																																													DESC:You do not gain all of the aspects of wild shape. At 8th-lvl, instead of Large animals you can change into small and medium vermin. At 11th-lvl, you can change into Tiny animals and vermin. At 12th-lvl, instead of plants, you can change into an animal or vermin based swarm. At 15th-lvl, instead of Huge creatures, you can change into Large animals or vermin. The 16th and 18th level aspects remain unchanged.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Druid ~ Wild Shape|Druid ACF ~ City-ShapeSA																																																																																																																																																																																																									COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:WebEn 1
