Astral Tracking						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:Bloodline		DESC:You can track a creature normally through the Astral [base Survival DC 25].  When standing th the location [on any plane] where a creature departed by means of Teleportation, you can determine the destination with a DC 30 survival check.  If you  have your own means of teleportation, you can teleport to that location as if you had viewed it once. 
