Bend Spell							CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:Metamagic				ADDSPELLLEVEL:1			DESC:Target of this spell gets no AC bonus or Save bonus against this spell due to cover.  This does not allow you to target creatures with total cover. 
Braced For Charge					CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General				DESC:Allows you to set a polearm against a charge for double damage - with weapons that do not normally do double damage against a charge. 
