Charming							CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General					PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Negotiator				PRESTAT:1,CHA=13		DESC:When you make a charisma check to exert control over the target of a mind-affecting spell you cast, gain +3 to this roll.  This applies to checks to convince the target of a Charm spell to do something they would not normally do, as well as opposed charisma checks make by two spellcasters affecting the same target. 
Circle Student						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General.Fighter					PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Dodge	PRESKILL:1,Concentration=2	PRETOTALAB:4	DESC:When you designate a target for Dodge, you may increase the dodge bonus to AC by 1, and gain a +1 competence bonus to hit that creature, but you take -2 to AC vs all other creatures. 
Circle Master						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General.Fighter					PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Dodge		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Circle Student		PRESKILL:1,Concentration=4	PRETOTALAB:8		DESC:Increase the AC and attack bonuses granted by circle student by 1.
Combat CHarm						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General							PRESTAT:1,WIS=13		DESC:When you cast a Charm spell in combat on a creature threatened by you or your allies, the target does not gain the usual +5 bonus to its save against the spell.
