Cuthbert's Smite					CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General					PREDEITY:1,St. Cuthbert		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.PaladinSmiteEvil		BONUS:VAR|SmiteEvilTimes|1	DESC:You may smite chaos as well as evil, and may smite an additional time per day.
Cutpurse							CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General			PRESKILL:1,Sleight Of Hand=5		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Unarmed Strike		DESC:You may disguise sleight-of-hand attempts as combat maneuves.  You may use sleight-of-hand to pickpocket enemy combatants without provoking an attack of opportunity.
Dead Eye							CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General			PRESTAT:1,DEX=17	PRETOTALAB:14		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Weapon Focus		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Point Blank Shot			DESC:You can add your dexterity bonus to ranged attacks with weapons you have weapon focus with, as long as the target is not immune to critical hits and is within 30'
Deceptive Dodge						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General			PRETOTALAB:4	PRESTAT:1,DEX=13		PRESTAT:1,INT=13			PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Dodge		DESC:When a melee attack by the subject of your dodge feat misses you while you are fighting defensively, that attack has a chance to strike another target of your choice that is adjacent to both you and the attacker.  The attacker must make a new attack roll for the redirected attack, using the same modifiers applied to the missed attack.  You may use this feat oncer per round.
Divine Fervor						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General		PREDEITY:1,Y		DESC:1/Day, gain +2 to one ability score.  Lasts 1+Charisma Modifier rounds, minimum 1. 
Divine Conduit						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General	PRESTAT:1,CHA=13		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Divine Fervor		PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Turn Undead,Rebuke Undead		DESC:Touch a divine spellcaster who worships the same deity and expend a number of Turn attempts.  These can be used as spell levels by the target to apply a metamagic feat to the next spell they cast.  Spell takes its normal time to cast, obviating Quicken Spell. 
